  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Translation and Interpretation Services 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The purpose of this contract is to support the activities of the EU Office in Kosovo with translation and interpretation services. More specifically the contract will ensure that in all public events, steering committees, bilateral meetings with beneficiaries, during meetings when High Officials from Brussels visit Kosovo to provide interpretation from English-Albanian-English and Serbian-English &#xbf;Serbian, as well as to provide written translation of documents in the languages mentioned above as per EU Office in Kosovo requirements.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
